<title>JAPAN: Furukawa Eng - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Furukawa Eng - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.17		vs	   10.33</p>
<p> Operating   loss 591    mln	  vs	prft 175 mln</p>
<p> Current     loss 561    mln	  vs	prft 154 mln</p>
<p> Net	   loss 571    mln	  vs	 prft 90 mln</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 44.42 yen	  vs     prft 8.17 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     13 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Furukawa Engineering &amp; Construction is the full company name.</p>
</text>
